<https://hcis.io/ontology/aicapstone/2026/group01> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This ontology models cup stacking, cutlery arrangement, and toy block collection objects as typed individuals with task roles, perception labels, pose-frame identifiers, and affordance-based graspability inference."@en .
<https://hcis.io/ontology/aicapstone/2026/group01> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://hcis.io/ontology/aicapstone/2026/group01> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Group 1 Semantic Affordance Grounding Ontology"@en .
<https://hcis.io/ontology/aicapstone/2026/group01> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "g01" .
<https://hcis.io/ontology/aicapstone/2026/group01> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://hcis.io/ontology/aicapstone/2026/group01/" .
<https://hcis.io/ontology/aicapstone/2026/group01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A group-authored ontology for grounding baseline AI Capstone task objects and connecting the cup-stacking final project to graspability reasoning."@en .
<https://hcis.io/ontology/aicapstone/2026/group01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Group 1 Semantic Affordance Grounding Ontology"@en .
